dw/20260601/1138072919084109824910735.jpeg/jvUBhnKeXoqyUOfee6r_FPgjynOvp_n8cKyCpXCsgqU\"/><figcaption>黃小金回到現場與記者講述當天事發過程（羊城晚報提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃小金店內被水泡壞的食材保鮮櫃（羊城晚報提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260601/1138073063577882624387914.jpeg/cusAqBz_3Q-ZHunAbprKxYgD8OQrnvWSrqGWZq6hlmY\"/><figcaption>黃小金店內被水泡壞的食材保鮮櫃（羊城晚報提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-17T04:39:54.918184+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2113,"images":24,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}